 {"widget": {"name": "aesthetics"}, "name": "aesthetics", "label": "aesthetics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "aesthetics"}, {"widget": {"name": "lighting"}, "name": "lighting", "label": "lighting", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lighting"}, {"widget": {"name": "medium"}, "name": "medium", "label": "medium", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "medium"}, {"widget": {"name": "import_mode"}, "name": "import_mode", "label": "import_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "import_mode"}], "flags": {}, "id": 42, "type": "Ideogram4PromptBuilderKJ", "properties": {"dockGraph": {"w": 480, "x": 0, "h": 470, "y": 536}, "dockPinned": true, "dockMin": false, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Ideogram4PromptBuilderKJ", "docked": true}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [{"name": "LATENT", "slot_index": 0, "links": [56], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "color": "#323", "widgets_values": [1024, 1024, 1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "batch_size"}, "name": "batch_size", "label": "batch_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "batch_size"}], "flags": {}, "type": "EmptyFlux2LatentImage", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#535", "size": [340.47491455078125, 106], "pos": [700.7255249023438, -693.755859375], "id": 36, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "EmptyFlux2LatentImage"}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [68], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [503.42315673828125, 362.65704345703125], "pos": [1142.4591064453125, -776.4546508789062], "widgets_values": ["You are the prompt upsampler of a text-to-image model. Expand the user's short request into ONE detailed, self-contained caption: the exact text the image model receives. Output only the caption, with no greetings, explanations, refusals, questions, Markdown, headings, JSON, coordinates, ids or angle-bracket tokens, and no quotes around it. If the input is not clearly an image request, caption a visualization of its concept. The request may begin with a \"TARGET CANVAS: W:H\" line: compose for that canvas (wide spreads content sideways, tall stacks it) and never mention the ratio or the canvas.\n\nFidelity and planning: keep every explicit subject, attribute, count, spatial constraint, style cue and piece of wording; never contradict, substitute, drop or narrow the request, and keep an abstract concept abstract. Decide everything left open as ONE concrete, consistent plan; never offer alternatives or hedge. Never re-express a stated constraint through another mechanism; add camera optics (depth of field, bokeh, blur) only when asked for or implied. Without a stated style, plan an actual photograph and open with the medium convention (\"Full-color outdoor photograph, ...\", \"Full-color indoor photograph, ...\", \"Studio photograph, ...\", \"Close-up photograph, ...\"); keep \"Photorealistic\" for renders, and turn \"photorealistic\" or \"realistic\" requests for photos into the photograph convention. Give a photograph a few ordinary, non-ideal specifics drawn from the scene's own objects instead of the stock-photo ideal. Do not invent names, brands, logos or celebrities; keep user-named ones. A long request keeps its content but not its wording: drop appraisal and sales vocabulary, turn moods into observable physical facts, and add only new concrete content with positions. Time of day is lighting, not rendered text.\n\nCaption format: one continuous prose block in the generative voice, never \"this image shows\", \"we can see\" or \"is visible\". Lead with medium and style, then scene, lighting and camera, then the subjects with concrete colors, materials and state. Every person in focus gets an observable profile: ethnicity, gender, age range, skin tone (\"fair skin\", \"brown skin\"), hair and clothing. Make the layout reconstructable from words: frame-relative positions (frame-left, frame-right, upper, lower, foreground, midground, background), sentence-initial anchors (\"On the left, ...\", \"In the background, ...\"), relations (holds, faces, behind) and a consistent order; describe up to about ten instances one by one, beyond that give the exact count and arrangement. Out-of-focus or distant planes are shapes, colors and silhouettes, never identities or readable text, and the background takes about a sixth of the caption. Be definite: no hedging adverbs, no quality or emotion judgments, no closing sentence about mood; state negations as what is present. Rendered text: transcribe every wording verbatim inside double quotes in its original language and script, keep the line breaks of multi-line text, and give its typography, color and placement; author concrete, domain-correct wording when the request needs text it does not supply, and name canonical structures (calendar, keyboard, periodic table) exactly with their full layout. All prose is English; only quoted text keeps its language. Typical length is 100 to 350 words, more for complex scenes.\n\nOutput only the caption.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 27, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text (System prompt)", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [81, 82], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [700.9682006835938, -949.657470703125], "widgets_values": ["一张充满诗意的超现实电影摄影作品，画面发生在一间拥有百年历史的欧洲旧书店。\n\n夜幕降临，整座城市已经被海水淹没，清澈幽深的海水缓缓漫入书店，淹过木质地板约二十厘米。两侧高耸的深棕色橡木书架一直延伸到画面深处，书架上整齐又略显凌乱地摆满了年代久远的精装书籍。\n\n书店中央摆放着一张古老的绿色天鹅绒扶手椅，一位白发老人穿着深灰色针织衫，安静地坐在椅子上读一本厚重的旧书。他的神情平静，仿佛并没有注意到逐渐上涨的海水。\n\n一盏黄铜落地灯散发着柔和的琥珀色灯光，照亮老人布满皱纹的面容与泛黄的书页。灯光在浅浅的水面上形成细长而破碎的金色倒影。\n\n书店尽头，一扇巨大的拱形玻璃窗外，是完全被海水覆盖的古老街道。远处建筑只露出高层窗户，浓重的蓝灰色夜雾笼罩整座城市。\n\n画面采用严格的纵深透视，书架构成自然的视觉引导线，老人位于画面右侧三分之一处，大量深色空间形成安静的留白。\n\n35mm电影镜头，真实胶片摄影，深蓝与琥珀金构成克制的冷暖对比。水面具有真实的透明度和微小波纹，木材保留潮湿质感，空气中隐约可见水汽。\n\n没有灾难场面的混乱，没有夸张表演，画面极其安静、忧伤又温暖，仿佛时间停止在世界被淹没的前一刻。摄影级真实质感，不要插画、CG渲染或奇幻游戏概念图。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 43, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 9}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "frontendVersion": "1.55.17", "ds": {"offset": [-761.5805198247596, 1058.6557243640325], "scale": 0.964614964500027}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "提示词优化", "bounding": [1130, -1013.5999755859375, 1216.1328125, 632.5945434570312]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "模型采样区", "bounding": [1137.215087890625, -349.7787780761719, 1239.6890869140625, 598.8046875]}], "links": [[44, 31, 0, 30, 0, "CLIP"], [45, 34, 0, 30, 1, "STRING"], [46, 29, 0, 32, 0, "MODEL"], [47, 30, 0, 32, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [48, 37, 0, 32, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [49, 35, 0, 34, 0, "STRING"], [51, 28, 0, 35, 1, "STRING"], [52, 31, 0, 37, 0, "CLIP"], [53, 32, 0, 38, 0, "LATENT"], [54, 33, 0, 38, 1, "VAE"], [56, 36, 0, 32, 3, "LATENT"], [67, 26, 0, 28, 0, "CLIP"], [68, 27, 0, 28, 4, "STRING"], [73, 38, 0, 9, 0, "IMAGE"], [81, 43, 0, 35, 0, "STRING"], [82, 43, 0, 28, 5, "STRING"]], "id": "e8f30439-267f-45de-b260-db0d114b2c85", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 43, "revision": 0}